{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c7dbd9d7dccf4bf75677b0e0150a52d0038d1771659fa11b7fc943578fabe964", "ja": "公演前、多忙なプロデューサーの代わりに\nトレーニングメニューを考えるも、可奈と\n桃子をダウンさせてしまい落ち込む千早。\nプロデューサーとの会話で、千早は『歌以外\nの時間』を楽しんでいる今の自分に気づく。", "zh": "演出前，千早替繁忙的制作人\n设计训练菜单，却让可奈与\n桃子累倒了，因而陷入低落。\n在与制作人的交谈中，千早察觉到\n现在的自己也懂得享受“唱歌以外的时光”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1000_null", "source_sha256": "b481e74e6f91a5a71324df500771ee4fcd895395c06bb4a3c1c609b1dd39f863", "ja": "レッスン初日・終了後……", "zh": "课程第一天·结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "72aa60642cf984371def7c9b9198e19364585d83fee8f0009cfc0e035331152e", "ja": "お疲れさま、着替えてきたよ！\n……って、大丈夫？　ふたりとも……。", "zh": "辛苦了，我换好衣服回来了！\n……那个，没事吧？你们两个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "bd67ce1a5d3db1df5a0efeadab70e4d38a0e6cf4f301d5532c007403245be36a", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですよ！\n……うぷっ。", "zh": "没、没事的！\n……呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "07093c9f7d1400c645dfb1fe52cc8c6504aa41c51ef9bafd9daf16b200e9f694", "ja": "桃子だって……うぷっ。", "zh": "桃子也……呕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "84c5b7b7a173c0a9e49c37d59a702a83034c67be7a0293f4dcb1e9d29e465768", "ja": "ふたりとも、無理しちゃダメだよ？　暑いし、\n脱水しちゃうと大変だから。ドリンク飲んでね！", "zh": "你们两个都不要勉强自己哦？天气很热，要是脱水了就麻烦了。记得喝饮料！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "aa23690e55d2914f6a173a96cc26ed597c2b39c8062e3fa38ff202ddbf6c806e", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい。\n無理をさせてしまったかしら……。", "zh": "对、对不起。\n是不是让你勉强自己了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "795a900cbb032a8e2f32456f737ec077b9ac5d84875b574953e5d48b97af54fb", "ja": "全然、そんなことないです！\n私が……うぷっ。", "zh": "完全没有那回事！\n我……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "52685546de4b60732a2142dd2b19a982aec72ec8b9ff12fe380536ce64aca536", "ja": "そうだよ、千早さん！\n桃子だって……うぷっ。", "zh": "没错，千早小姐！桃子也……呕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "173383660ece5034f7a506c80e79fd81cc8d7a99c132103d1098d77f8f4fa3b8", "ja": "もー、無理しないの！", "zh": "真是的，不要勉强自己啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "96049c7566e4930da957cfab80ea8597c75dadc4fddc05e82e9aaeb5d6093885", "ja": "あの、高槻さん。真。ふたりとも、\n今日のトレーニングは厳しかったと思う……？", "zh": "那个，高槻同学，真。你们两个，觉得今天的训练很辛苦……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "f71a87551fcc96b0716b1fb44dec62ebcfc22f79248204f4cd169318c8319188", "ja": "うん……まあ？", "zh": "嗯……算是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "5516eb5fd11e0548724c16f0de4edaba75031771de805f50a6e8fc87a502e3d3", "ja": "そうかも……？", "zh": "也许吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "0efa8ad47180eca14b1ce1f7f0b825f8b004491432d460ec34f7e72412a8a2a8", "ja": "そ、そう……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "18fd52f6aa6d2309e268f33dde8b4bad2361639262d7c5c4668c6d6f2d987726", "ja": "ボク達はほら、体力もあるし。経験もあるから、\n自分の限界はわかるっていうか……。", "zh": "我们毕竟体力还不错，也有经验，所以该怎么说呢……知道自己的极限在哪里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "1680d396b6a32dd61a897529857ba20bad9cc2ff6fdfe03f25087e2dfc3f49a1", "ja": "ふたりとも、ずっと全力だったもんね。\nすーっごくがんばってて、えらかったね！", "zh": "你们两个一直都在全力以赴呢。特别特别努力，真棒呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "236c73f66361a7447be9bc22b26d5b2cde6c01b6b7538e776426446933f16437", "ja": "やよいちゃんに、ほめてもらっちゃった～……\nえへへ……。", "zh": "被弥生夸奖了～……\n嘿嘿嘿……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "cca8aaee53a447e9dd941ef8ad7a99805f7cd23274af74f3ad256fd55b6ab3e0", "ja": "うう……\nうれしいけど、うれしくない……。", "zh": "呜呜……\n虽然很开心，但又开心不起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "ac076a20f573ee25fb68aabaf112b417f064fcb2dc4679e38ee1e97add78c32b", "ja": "ごめんなさい……明日は、メニューを変えないとね。\n真、相談に乗ってもらえるかしら。", "zh": "对不起……明天得换个菜单才行呢。\n真，你能听我商量一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "543164465b9a2c1a96541bdc032ada39a2fdd296ea629f423396480d23b98c50", "ja": "もちろん！　ただ、ボクとやよい、\nこの後雑誌のインタビューがあるんだよね。", "zh": "当然可以！不过，我和弥生接下来还有杂志采访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "4d5b2a65776b8fd8f04e61a7f7fff4d8e7c87845fd7c0ca45ac674c25a5d18db", "ja": "なら、明日の朝はどう？\n今晩中に他の案も考えておくから。", "zh": "那么，明天早上怎么样？\n我会在今晚之内再想想其他方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "f4ed98ee6e435b54d92c729f76380b50cd03d25fd65df39ac8a6acb2b441ff36", "ja": "それを、明日のレッスン前に確認してもらいたいの。", "zh": "我想请你在明天上课前确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "e715dbe5fdb76db45aa93213f4b486f290852d2574f3c4df38758319c8019284", "ja": "わかった、そうしよう！\nそれじゃ行こうか、やよい！", "zh": "明白了，就这么办吧！\n那我们走吧，弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "18713de650227e5c9621552056dc453d171c5165074a8ad09e213e0419f35cb9", "ja": "はい！　みんな、お疲れさまでした！\nまた明日ー！", "zh": "好的！大家辛苦了！\n明天见——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "45d3ee1b71d3c1250b91a84b5fdb95f1a293596557beaaee3143b8a221af7f20", "ja": "今日のトレーニング内容だと、\n矢吹さんと桃子には厳しい。だとしたら……。", "zh": "按今天的训练内容来看，对矢吹和桃子来说太勉强了。这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "c957796fc994a17a29c52bb3b8b9c795d63731e840d53510513d97666c158ee1", "ja": "前半のメニューが、重いのかもしれない……。\nなら、これを削って……。", "zh": "前半的训练内容，可能有点太重了……\n那就把这个删掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fcf82512240579bdff9d8f22a0c84cbf6556eaa0e0c0c5fba7d1f2d7ce6811f9", "ja": "ふう、やっと外回りが終わったぞ。あとは、\n帰ってセトリを……ん？　あそこにいるのは……。", "zh": "呼，终于跑完外勤了。接下来回去把演出歌单……嗯？那边的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "2bd4e79ef115bc16bf062d13e5f80281d66875e7329a295b920f5aaf43c414b8", "ja": "えっと……こういう場合って、\nどこに負荷を掛ければいいのかしら……。", "zh": "那个……这种情况下，应该给哪里增加负荷才好呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6075ea0fe772d2410f8c5492e06d6a01e38b701e6d0e409143424b72d9a576a6", "ja": "千早！\nこんなところでどうしたんだ？", "zh": "千早！\n怎么会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "1813595621245b8179fe1b02e5b3a204c0bc19efa28c6087bbe8142010ea8ffa", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "f10cb126dee2dd82b23b22917d5f53bac129225867574a13ae333a38243eca2b", "ja": "その。明日のトレーニング内容を、\n考え直しているのですが……。", "zh": "那个……我正在重新考虑明天的训练内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1031_p", "source_sha256": "29981777c6cba12f4fc5f78b76355e48cd5c88dd59f6fe855b93cfa3bf27109d", "ja": "ははっ、なるほど。千早のメニューは、\n可奈と桃子にはまだキツかったみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。看来千早的训练菜单对可奈和桃子来说还是太辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "30b760dadaf2b6ddd2ee43cfb85e2672e2340726f14a9ef13d6c997ccfc554c8", "ja": "{$P$}、笑わないでください。\nふたりとも、一生懸命だったんですから。", "zh": "{$P$}，请不要笑。\n毕竟她们两个都已经很努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0ecf6ac2f7c0db7b7b13d1034785b69d27118bb6cc6ec090cdda7a3d49798b8a", "ja": "そうだな、ごめん。でもそんな状態でも、可奈も\n桃子も最後までついてきたんだろう？　すごいな。", "zh": "是啊，对不起。不过即使在那种状态下，可奈和桃子也都坚持到了最后吧？真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "ff5dd2ee9fd009100c7cf12733584f2821d79b06bccc4a0d1f8b094c6b55eaa3", "ja": "はい。……だからでしょうか。\n余計に、なんだか申し訳ない気がしていて。", "zh": "是的……或许正因为如此吧。\n总觉得越发过意不去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "4ce44a09e2d4d97a401223b1dd768d318aa44f1c8b0434303f7c6e0361e55bf6", "ja": "ふたりとも、せっかく頑張ってくれたのに。\nこのメニューで、本当によかったんだろうかと。", "zh": "明明两个人都特意努力过了。\n我却在想，选这个菜单真的好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1036_p", "source_sha256": "13bb2f2b36b5035a14f1c8e8ab8853d368ed68fc0f80982ee0746f6120bc7316", "ja": "そうか。でも、そんなに\n気に病まなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，你也不用这么忧心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1037_p", "source_sha256": "6018f2635274cc003165555d6425826f04c4457ca92ff4812ec21aca82de2b6a", "ja": "ふたりが頑張ったのは、『千早は、普段からこれを\nこなしている』って聞いたからだと思うんだ。", "zh": "我想，两个人之所以那么努力，是因为听说“千早平时一直都在做这个”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1038_002chi", "source_sha256": "8bce8aa26f80e4ceee90b3c9f4470e5d079ea113e959bfe8d2f5fca59bd6e21f", "ja": "そうでしょうか……？", "zh": "是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e7af1dc653f9a556b8236c6db01319a31b951d842488c4ac453292ad2297f68c", "ja": "うん。ミーティングからふたりとも気合いが入ってた。\n千早の公演に出られるのが、嬉しかったんだろうな。", "zh": "嗯。从开会的时候起，两个人就干劲十足。\n能出演千早的演出，她们一定很高兴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1040_p", "source_sha256": "41fd28112878a48aae420e04652bb71effa73ab08f57d7dbd616df4c69855886", "ja": "だから、必死でついて行こうとしたんだと思う。\n結果的に、マイナス部分が浮き彫りになったけど……。", "zh": "所以，我想她们才会拼命想跟上。结果反而让不足之处暴露出来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1041_002chi", "source_sha256": "ab57180857fc30047eb75aec0857bc8a88790d3e68855aa8445f50665915ad83", "ja": "マイナスだなんて、そんな事は……\nふたりとも、基礎はしっかりしています。", "zh": "说什么负面，这种事……\n你们两个人的基础都很扎实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "d04df8ca78781a250711a579ef722242f61337c9a86b80d4252ae29a55a88834", "ja": "それに私がこなしているメニューは、私が自分の\n弱いところを補うために考えたものですから。", "zh": "而且，我正在进行的训练项目，是我为了弥补自己的\n弱点而制定的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1044_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1045_002chi", "source_sha256": "e86dc27e30820977ea067ca475173e4ccf4bf8e2ffb2baba587d906eb9016925", "ja": "いえ。……今日のトレーニングは、\n元々、私が自分のために組んだメニューだったので。", "zh": "不。……今天的训练，\n原本是我为自己制定的训练方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1046_002chi", "source_sha256": "0c909e9f71d6968aafb048e3f43c51c25324d1a80ca60da6c44a0bee972b843b", "ja": "きついかどうか以前に……内容が、\nふたりには合っていないのかもしれない、と思って。", "zh": "比起辛不辛苦……我觉得，或许这套训练内容本身就不适合你们两个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1047_p", "source_sha256": "ee32d391f9a709863710b5dd81b637da408e48cab178b0d346854c32c379fc33", "ja": "うん、いいところに気づいたな！　体力や経験に\n差があるように、得意な事も人によって違う。", "zh": "嗯，注意得很好！就像体力和经验有\n差距一样，每个人擅长的事也各有不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1048_p", "source_sha256": "6b4aaf33df75140717bec000e990c50372d04609e23d3d36a83f0dfc66bc0e22", "ja": "例えば、可奈は意外と肺活量がある。\n吹奏楽なんかの楽器が得意だからかもしれない。", "zh": "比如，可奈的肺活量意外地很强。\n或许是因为她擅长吹奏乐之类的乐器吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "c47f4c8fa7a3aba2d2533936ee8c2d58eac3d96dccce11d03a827346af61118f", "ja": "はい。桃子は、やはり表現がとても豊かで……。\n卓越していると思います。", "zh": "是的。桃子的表现力果然非常丰富……\n我认为她十分出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1050_p", "source_sha256": "c95afc3343fe2cdeee976119d6f6f0baeb83f0b4144d5bf3696d9c2ec9f00204", "ja": "そういう個性を踏まえて、あとは、本人がこの公演で\nどうしたいか。もっと言うと、将来、どうなりたいか。", "zh": "考虑到这些个性，接下来就是她本人想在这场公演中做到什么。说得更具体一点，就是将来想成为什么样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1052_p", "source_sha256": "245affe71a623a1b3953a42168c0579d2e0bed99cb0cad88eab961d9f578f0ca", "ja": "その上で、改めて\nメニューを組んでみるといいかもしれないな。", "zh": "在此基础上，再重新制定菜单，或许会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1053_002chi", "source_sha256": "fce974b3f632d2c95020b72052b0d5efd75a492d84556b26948fbcd1710f94d4", "ja": "……わかりました。アドバイスありがとうございます、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "……我明白了。谢谢您的建议，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1054_p", "source_sha256": "175461b81336c5b854652f0cde97eb31214f2fc6166fe3902a2915e72a1fe42f", "ja": "どういたしまして。千早こそ、\n忙しいのに色々引き受けてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "不客气。千早才是，明明很忙还帮忙做了这么多，谢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1055_002chi", "source_sha256": "2949be33ac4259dfcd3d22007a15aeca966fcc88c06cf3d6dab24073fba930ff", "ja": "いえ。自分が言いだした事ですから。\n最後まで、やらせてもらおうかと。", "zh": "不，毕竟是我自己提出来的事。所以，我想做到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1056_002chi", "source_sha256": "a1e1f795bf9ce60955adc216b4b443bf125967f57b984ec26f00f1f4566ceb87", "ja": "トレーニングメニューを考えるのは得意な方だと思って\nいましたが、他の人のためとなると全然違いますね。", "zh": "我原以为自己还算擅长制定训练菜单，但要为别人制定时，完全是另一回事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1057_002chi", "source_sha256": "6fe81a736c47fe208f1e6be0a5151a3d79beb52a8c388aa61d280fdf3501d603", "ja": "今回やってみて、初めてわかりました。\n……ふふっ。", "zh": "这次试过之后，我才第一次明白。\n……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1058_p", "source_sha256": "c182c34b16d443ce80183e454612d77236d45bd4811606301b3e3dd91d25a966", "ja": "？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1059_002chi", "source_sha256": "c429336fce1468a191ead9c2dc3808e1c9a98f341516faabcdc6aeb711ce65fb", "ja": "いえ、ただ……こういった事は『時間を取られる』と\n思って避けてきたので……新鮮だな、と。", "zh": "不是，只是……我一直觉得这种事会“占用时间”，所以都尽量避开了……现在觉得很新鲜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1060_p", "source_sha256": "d8a82a392658320628a95ee7cd701696625ad68e9b56cb37478ef2f2323d9f93", "ja": "そうか。……もう、避けないんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。……你已经不再逃避了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1061_002chi", "source_sha256": "85e5eedf2dbddbb36178a13e6d9f68f76d5c26e701ea2f545c2c442f455c6ab1", "ja": "はい。私の持っている知識や経験が、\nみんなの役に立つなら使いたい、と思います。", "zh": "是的。如果我所拥有的知识和经验能帮助到大家，我想把它们运用起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1062_002chi", "source_sha256": "45385143151147552913b369525abc14073bfdeede7cfc5a2900b3444100648c", "ja": "それに……みんなが良くなる事で、\n私自身、影響を受けるはずなので。", "zh": "而且……如果大家能变得更好，\n我自己也一定会受到影响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1063_002chi", "source_sha256": "8897adcbfe97d32928f65a5a9e8f089ced047f864be617f9f8d4e65e11f68ddb", "ja": "その方が、いい公演になります。\n……きっと。", "zh": "那样的话，公演会更精彩。\n……一定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1064_p", "source_sha256": "d8d317677ae1ded44942e6ee50a71acaf3a5fff85483aaa22c77123894ac8c34", "ja": "千早……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1065_p", "source_sha256": "31861b932f0d249b6fdae5d1a4b831b9c67730fe40482c31963686d82f224689", "ja": "（千早が、仲間という存在に影響を受けたように。\n千早の影響で、周囲もまた変わる。良い方向に……）", "zh": "（千早受到了同伴们的影响。周围的人也因为千早而改变了，朝着好的方向……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1066_002chi", "source_sha256": "c2a8d5ce7ee0ddda8767fe518f0636eaeb93b8b8e984e925c9cf9cc80b8de662", "ja": "{$P$}。\n新曲公演、楽しみですね。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n新歌公演，很令人期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1067_p", "source_sha256": "1991dc587787514f16661edf7c0b9c39fa5ad99c62ef3f71426d186f16412d3c", "ja": "ああ。楽しみだよ！", "zh": "啊。很期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1068_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1069_036kan", "source_sha256": "1f3403a22ad989d40c5b46214f1b3b5206ee07d8920f190212569cf2e6a19106", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、大丈夫……？\n私、まだちょっと疲れてるかも～……。はう～……。", "zh": "桃子，没事吧……？\n我可能还有点累～……唉～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1070_049mom", "source_sha256": "3d2cd2fb60d8a9da0da1131c290cc9ce8d1562bfa0924dd4fdf72a9872f1b42e", "ja": "うん……桃子も、ちょっと……。\nで、でも、ちょっと！　ちょっとだけだから！", "zh": "嗯……桃子也、有点……。\n但、但是，只是一点点！就只有一点点而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1071_036kan", "source_sha256": "45fb5c075b7ed4fb5d955bb9b86ba48fc5c4a9060a8b20bf162290109bc8f1e0", "ja": "はぁ……。せっかくレッスン初日だったのに、\nいいところ全然見せられなかったね～……。", "zh": "唉……难得是训练的第一天，\n却完全没能展现出好的一面呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1072_049mom", "source_sha256": "6dcb6261bd0f92a197c1e3099da74f67c4c11a71b46a1bcea9c5f71d354a3715", "ja": "……ねえ、可奈さん。桃子たち、もしかして\nメンバー交代とかさせられちゃうのかな……？", "zh": "……我说，可奈小姐。桃子我们，该不会\n要被换出成员阵容了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1073_036kan", "source_sha256": "71071eb6b18356c171a3232af9843db5d6bdd8229f2dedc13612dfc03eab4999", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうして！？\nそんなのヤダヤダ～！！！", "zh": "诶诶！？为、为什么！？  \n那种事我不要不要啊～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1074_049mom", "source_sha256": "d4bab451c94610ebbe0c17175a88f4880427f43ff6fa8ee7965abb4c05c99fcd", "ja": "桃子もイヤだけど！　でも桃子たち、\n全然ついていけてなかったでしょ。", "zh": "桃子也不愿意啊！可是桃子她们，\n根本就完全跟不上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1075_049mom", "source_sha256": "b4a70c477862eef1cdf8378d99f727a0c5bf0c24ec1267ee276e39ab1178d354", "ja": "それに今日も、ふたりだけ先に呼ばれてるし……\nもしかして、って……。", "zh": "而且今天也只有你们两个先被叫走了……所以我就在想，会不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
