{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1078_036kan", "source_sha256": "44379c50d3d776429f707d4cf7cfa350cde5245e13977da1a38d27b690191f3a", "ja": "！　い、いえっ！", "zh": "！不、不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1079_049mom", "source_sha256": "9c651f073c8c190ce817d836056ceeb78a240538258a2390dcab563f700894b7", "ja": "あ、あの、千早さん！　もしかして、\n公演のメンバー、交代……とか……？", "zh": "啊、那个，千早小姐！难道说，公演的成员要……换人……之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1080_002chi", "source_sha256": "fb3537fbfca5044eb20e80f6ca7a48596132569f5943b9b5437b654b885d6b2b", "ja": "え？　交代って……何故？", "zh": "咦？你说的换人……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1081_049mom", "source_sha256": "c4128cbc326391bed2103062246e7b9dd68d0030c69cdcaf2f5a7bd38a09f6a5", "ja": "桃子たち、全然ついていけてなかったから……\nで、でも！　がんばるから！　交代、したくない！", "zh": "因为桃子她们完全跟不上……\n但、但是！桃子会努力的！不想换人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1082_036kan", "source_sha256": "07498cfc643c2ce8c9cb3aba1c09a9f07698b41c2de2638af83249dbc699b5bf", "ja": "わ、私もです！　足りないところは、がんばります！\nだから、交代だけはしないでください～っ！", "zh": "我、我也是！不足的地方，我一定会努力的！\n所以，请千万不要换人啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1083_002chi", "source_sha256": "7857ab848524c0bbb926be060a024b75b5d69fe41d1ed2ac471a3ae4f7d2e9a2", "ja": "……ふたりとも、顔を上げて。\n交代なんて……。", "zh": "……你们两个，抬起头来。\n怎么可能换人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1084_002chi", "source_sha256": "b890955849d99adaed24f639a46665ee22f2de51176905afa946a480371f172d", "ja": "今日来てもらったのは、トレーニングの内容について、\nふたりがどうしたいか意見を聞かせてほしかったの。", "zh": "今天请你们过来，是想听听你们对训练内容有什么意见，想怎么安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1085_036kan", "source_sha256": "f78c5816ec87e78c383b97f80a84bd93aca4c30b328d13ea9db02c5de14b4ca5", "ja": "え。わ、私たちの意見……ですか？", "zh": "诶。要、要听我们的意见……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_135_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_135_1086_002chi", "source_sha256": "93e05ed32a3bc03a8d27c36e9819af92412c3d2f076b1ee0f7fc8a26163eb7ec", "ja": "ええ。前回のメニューは、今の私用のものだから。\nふたりに合った内容を考えたいの。", "zh": "嗯。因为上次的训练菜单是针对现在的我制定的。\n我想为你们两个人考虑更合适的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
